        "Wild BGM ignores foe contents/count/levels; nextBattleBGM > nonempty map wild > nonempty global wild > default. DefaultBGM host override/media gating/volume and memory consumption stay WP15/WP24 boundaries"
      ],
      "messages": "Actual one/two-foe introduction is battle pbDisplayPaused→scene pause+skipAhead, not generic message resume; partner send-out follows that scene. Contest ball exhaustion announcer is only single-contest normal-return budget branch. Full battle UI/contest message catalogs not accepted here.",
      "normal_return": "Wrapper normal return resumes BGM/BGS, clears memorized BGM+position and4 nextBattle presets, resets encounter step count, fades0.4 target and clears in_battle; step caller later clears encounter_type/sets trigger/reset forceSingle. No ensure guarantee; heal precedes wrapper after-yield cleanup.",
